                    "site": "",
                    "synopsis": "Seven years before the fabled gates of Saranjana open, the forbidden love between Rusmiati (Putri Intan Kasela) and Badri (Rio Dewanto) fractures under the weight of tradition and a grim prophecy. Pushed to the brink, Rusmiati turns to the forbidden magic of Kuyang, unleashing a chilling terror that preys on newborns and pregnant women across the village. As panic erupts into violence and the crowd’s hunger for justice turns savage, Badri faces an impossible choice: save the woman he loves or stand with a community demanding blood. Will their love survive when the darkness claims its price?",
