                    "site": "",
                    "synopsis": "The arrival of MIA (Mawar Butterfly) as a new lecturer on campus accidentally coimcided with an event of moss possession experienced by the student. Although it was easly resolved by LIZA (Monique Henry), THE RECTOR it didn’t eliminate the effect on several students, one of whom was LOLY (Nadya Ulya). The student whom shared a room with GWEN (Dea Annisa)(Dea Annisa) in the FEMALE DORMITORY became more sensitive and easily possessed. However, possession was not the only problem on campus, the prostitution business run by MIKO (Bima Prawira) and BENY (Surya R Kusumah) was also avite disturbing to the students there. All these problems spiraled out of control with the presence of SALLY. A female ghost figure with a human like body whom, in every appearance, brought victims to death. GWEN and MIA tried to solve all the problems that existed on campus, especially in the FEMALE DORMITORY, tracing sally connection with everone on campus. Until a story was found in a diary, which was allegedly owned by SALLY, revealing that SALLY, during her lifetime, had once loved a lecturer named LAZUARDI (Samuel Rizal), whom SALLY eventually came to hate deeply.",
