                    "writer": "Ridho Brado",
                    "player": "Oki Rengga, Michelle Ziudith, Lolox, Andri Mashadi, Adi Sudirja, Mathias Muchus, Nela Regar, Rina Sidabutar",
                    "site": "",
                    "synopsis": "Alung (Lolox), Igor (Andri Mashadi), and Ujay (Oki Rengga) are three best friends who work as a freelance event organizing team. Tired of the gig economy, they finally decide to start their own company. Operating out of a shophouse owned by Alung’s family—located right near a bustling traditional market—they name their new venture AIU EO. \r\n\r\nIn their early days, they landed several clients with rather bizarre events. Eventually, they cross paths with Udin, a wealthy businessman who hires them to organize his lavish and grand wedding. During the preparations, they are shocked to discover that Udin’s (Adi Sudirja) fiance is Sofia (Michelle Ziudith), who happens to be Igor’s old friend from middle school. \r\n\r\nSofia’s marriage to Udin is an arranged union forced by her parents. In an unexpected turn of events, Sofia begs Igor to help her call off the wedding. Igor enlists Ujay’s help to carry out this mission behind Alung’s back. They know Alung is deeply invested in this project, convinced it will be the \"big break\" that brings massive profits to AIU EO. \r\n\r\nAs time passes, Udin’s true colors begin to show, making Igor and Ujay even more determined to sabotage the wedding. However, this means they are essentially betraying Alung. As Igor spends more time plotting with Sofia, sparks begin to fly, and a romantic bond develops between them. \r\n\r\nWill they succeed in stopping Udin and Sofia’s wedding? What will become of AIU EO? And how will the story end for Igor and Sofia?",
                    "can_buy": true,
                    "movie_image": "https://nos.jkt-1.neo.id/media.cinema21.co.id/movie-images/16AMBA.jpg",
