                    "site": "",
                    "synopsis": "Alma (Michelle Ziudith) falls in love with Budi (Yoshi Sudarso), a charming man who saves her life and seems to be the perfect partner. However, her happiness shatters when Alma discovers that Budi is a master con artist who has drained her savings and vanished without a trace. \r\n\r\nTeaming up with Ayu (Niken Anjani) and Uli (Givina)—two other women who have also fallen victim to Budi—Alma devises a revenge plan to expose his true nature to the public. Their next target is Thalita (Gisella Anastasia), a top diva who is now engaged to Budi. \r\n\r\nFilled with disguises, outrageous mishaps, and unexpected twists, Balas Budi is a romantic comedy about love, trust, and betrayal—with one ultimate goal: getting even with Budi.",
