                    "site": "",
                    "synopsis": "On her 20th birthday, ANGEL (Zee Asadel) had to lose her father PABLO (Verdi Solaiman) who was murdered sadistically and mysteriously. Together with the Red Dragon gang led by VINCENT (Zack Lee), SISCA (Aulia Sarah), CHANDRA (Irwan Chandra) and HANS (Hendric Shinigami) who were like her own uncle and aunt, Angel tried to find out who really killed her father and tried to take revenge. But this instead led her into the dark world of two gangster groups who were always at war, full of intrigue and betrayal, between Red Dragon and South Wild led by BARA (Donny Damara) and his confidant MARTIN (Marsyel Ririhena) and BOY (Damara Finch) who was Angel's ex-lover. Angel was then faced with a reality that shook her life, when the dark secrets of the past were slowly revealed.",
