                    "title": "RUMAH TANPA CAHAYA",
                    "duration": 102,
                    "genre": "Drama, Family",
                    "age_limit": 15,
                    "rating": "R13+",
                    "movie_type": "2D",
                    "distributor": "21eafa20-bf52-4758-bea8-c39e14a55aef",
                    "producer": "Zairin Zain",
                    "director": "Odi Harahap",
                    "writer": "Syaikhu Luthfi, Deddy Mizwar, Zairin Zain, Odi Harahap, Amiruddin Olland, Rafi Muhammad Zuhdi",
                    "player": "Ira Wibowo, Donny Damara, Lavicky Nicholas, Ridwan A. Ghany, Dea Annisa, Galabby Thahira, Ence Bagus, Widi Dwinanda",
                    "site": "",
                    "synopsis": "Nurul (Ira Wibowo) is the soul and guiding light of Qomar’s family (Donny Damara). A devoted mother who raises her two sons with boundless love, she also sustains the household through tireless work and unwavering prayers. The Empal Gentong food stall she builds becomes not only the family’s source of livelihood, but also a place of warmth for everyone who comes by, including those in need whom she serves without hesitation.\r\n\r\nWhen Nurul passes away, the family’s world collapses overnight. The once lively stall falls silent. Qomar sinks into loneliness, while Samsul (Ridwan A. Ghany) and Azizi (Lavicky Nicholas) are forced to confront the true meaning of a mother’s presence, only after she is gone.\r\n\r\nWith Nurul gone, the family loses its anchor. The bridge that once connected them is broken. Harmony fades. A home that was once filled with light is now left in darkness, lost, directionless, and without hope.\r\n\r\nRumah Tanpa Cahaya (A House Without Light) is a powerful story of a family left fractured by loss, of a mother’s love that continues to shine even after her passing, and of a moving journey to rediscover the light that can bring them back together.",
                    "can_buy": true,
                    "movie_image": "https://nos.jkt-1.neo.id/media.cinema21.co.id/movie-images/16RATA.jpg",
                    "trailer": "https://nos.jkt-1.neo.id/media.cinema21.co.id/movie-trailer/16RATA.mp4",
