                    "player": "Bella Graceva, Zikri Daulay, Jinan Safa, Yatti Surachman, Josiah Hogan, Sharifah Husna, Dewi Amanda, Sean Mikhail",
                    "site": "",
                    "synopsis": "Bound and restrained after repeated possessions that endanger her family, Lydia pleads with Nadine to destroy a cursed tree in her parents’ hometown the dwelling place of a malevolent jinn known as Iblis Waru. Her final warning is dismissed as the ramblings of a disturbed woman, until Lydia’s death unleashes a wave of terrifying hauntings upon Nadine, Adrian (Zikri Daullay), Anya (Jinan Safa), and Haqi (Sean Mikhail). \r\n\r\nHaunted by guilt and escalating supernatural terror, they travel to the old family house left behind by Nadine’s grandparents, deep in the forest, to search for the cursed tree. There, the disturbances intensify, including the appearance of a ghostly old woman revealed to be the manifestation of Iblis Waru itself, determined to thwart their mission. \r\n\r\nThe discovery of an ancient Javanese script uncovers a horrifying truth: Lydia had once entered a pesugihan pact with Iblis Waru, trading wealth and prosperity for an annual human head as sacrifice. The arrival of Reza (Josiah Hogan) and Sarah (Syarifah Husna) deepens the conflict when it is revealed that the pact was made to secure the family’s livelihood after a divorce. With time running out, the only way to stop the curse is to destroy the cursed tree imbued with dark supernatural power before Iblis Waru claims its next victim.",
                    "can_buy": true,
                    "movie_image": "https://nos.jkt-1.neo.id/media.cinema21.co.id/movie-images/16WARU.jpg",
